{"id":"word:hebrew:H6172","type":"word","title":"עֶרְוָה","subtitle":"H6172 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"nudity , literally (especially the pudenda) or figuratively (disgrace, blemish)","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to עֶרְוָה (H6172) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 54 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"עֶרְוָה (ʻervâh) means nudity , literally (especially the pudenda) or figuratively (disgrace, blemish) First listed occurrence: 1Sam 20 30."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"עֶרְוָה","transliteration":"ʻervâh","pronunciation":"er-vaw'","strong":"H6172","lemmaId":"hebrew:H6172","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["עֶרְוַ֥ת","עֶרְוַ֣ת","עֶרְוָתָֽ/הּ","עֶרְוָתְ/ךָ֖","עֶרְוָ֑ה"],"morphs":[["HNcfsc",27],["HNcfsc/Sp3fs",12],["HNcfsc/Sp2fs",5],["HC/Ncfsc",3],["HNcfsc/Sp2ms",2],["HNcfsa",2],["HNcfsc/Sp3fp",2],["HNcfsc/Sp3ms",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"nudity , literally (especially the pudenda) or figuratively (disgrace, blemish)","usage":"nakedness, shame, unclean(-ness).","full":"H6172. ervah עֶרְוָה 54 noun feminine nakedness, pudenda ; — absolute ׳ע Exod 28:42 ; Lev 18:6 ; usually construct עֶרְוַת Gen 9:22 +, suffix עֶרְוָתְךָ Exod 20:23 (Ginsb), Lev 18:10 ; עֶרְוָתֵךְ Isa 47:3 +; ת֯וֺ Lev 20:17 , תָ֯הּ 18:7 +; suffix 3 feminine plural עֶרְוָתָן 18:9 ; 18:10 ; &#8212; 1 pudenda , of man ע ׳רָאָה implying shameful exposure Gen 9:22-23 , (J); mostly of woman: figurative of Jerusalem (with רָאָה ) Lam 1:3 ; Ezek 16:37 ; usually with נלה ׃ literal ע ׳תִּגָּלֶה i.e. be exposed to view Exod 20:23 (Ginsb; van d. H. 20:26 ; E), so, as shameful punishment, figurative of Egypt Isa 20:4 (gloss according to Du Che Di-Kit), Babylonian 47:3 , of Jerusalem Ezek 16:37 ; 23:10 , 29 ( זְנוּנַיִךְ עֶרְוַת ; all three object of active verb); chiefly euphemism for cohabitation, ע ׳גִּלָּה Lev 18:6 + (see גלה Pi`el 1 a ; figurative of Jerusalem (verb passive) Ezek 16:36 ; ע ׳רָאָה in same meaning Lev 20:17 (twice in verse) (H; of both sexes); ׳ע also 18:8 , 10 , 16 (H); ע ׳כִּסָּה cover nakedness Gen 9:23 (J), Exod 28:42 (P; ע ׳בְּשַׂר ), Hosea 2:11 (figurative of Israel), Ezek 16:8 (of Jerusalem); reviling words are ע ׳לְבשֶׁת אִמֶּ֑ךָ 1Sam 20:30 (compare Doughty Arab. Deserta i. 269 ). 2 דָּבָר עֶרְוַת nakedness of a thing , i.e. probably indecency , improper behaviour Deut 23:15 ; 24:1 (see Dr). 3 figurative ׳ע הָאָרֶץ Gen 42:9 , 12 (E), i.e. its exposed, undefended parts (Arabic ).","rootNote":"from 6168 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Sam 20 30","keyReferences":["1Sam 20 30","Deut 23 15","Deut 24 1","Exod 20 26","Exod 28 42","Ezek 16 8","Ezek 16 36","Ezek 16 37"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":54,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Sam 20 30","book":"1Sam","chapter":20,"verse":30,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֶרְוַ֥ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc"},{"reference":"Deut 23 15","book":"Deut","chapter":23,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֶרְוַ֣ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc"},{"reference":"Deut 24 1","book":"Deut","chapter":24,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֶרְוַ֣ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc"},{"reference":"Exod 20 26","book":"Exod","chapter":20,"verse":26,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֶרְוָתְ/ךָ֖","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"Exod 28 42","book":"Exod","chapter":28,"verse":42,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֶרְוָ֑ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsa"},{"reference":"Ezek 16 8","book":"Ezek","chapter":16,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֶרְוָתֵ֑/ךְ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp2fs"},{"reference":"Ezek 16 36","book":"Ezek","chapter":16,"verse":36,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֶרְוָתֵ֔/ךְ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp2fs"},{"reference":"Ezek 16 37","book":"Ezek","chapter":16,"verse":37,